@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Architecture — Component Overview

actor "User" as User
component "GUI (JavaFX)" as GUI
component "CLI" as CLI
component "Application" as Application <<facade>>
component "Logic" as Logic <<orchestrator>>
component "Service" as Service
component "Storage" as Storage
component "Model" as Model
component "Common" as Common

User --> GUI
User --> CLI
GUI --> Application
CLI --> Logic
CLI ..> Application : wires via ApplicationFactory
Application --> Logic
Logic --> Service
Logic --> Storage
GUI ..> Model
CLI ..> Model
Application ..> Model
Logic ..> Model
Service ..> Model
Storage ..> Model
Logic ..> Common
Service ..> Common
Storage ..> Common
@enduml
